title: Brand impersonation asking for credentials
severity: high
score: 45
tags: phishing, brand-impersonation
attack: T1656
description: A page presents a known brand and asks for credentials, but is not hosted on
  that brand's domains.
---
// A page imitates a brand with confidence 60 or more and asks for a secret.
brand_claim
| where confidence >= 60 and isnotempty(prompt)
| project brand, confidence, prompt, url, evidence
